[TELEGRAM MARKET INTEL]
In 2025 Telegram, virality = information asymmetry + immediate utility. Users forward content that makes them feel ahead of the curve without requiring extensive explanation. Channels that win combine: (1) Daily cadence, (2) Hyper-specific niche, (3) Data/proof-heavy claims, (4) Actionable takeaways, (5) Subtle exclusivity (invite-only elements boost perceived value). Pure entertainment alone underperforms—value must be tangible.

