[INSTAGRAM MARKET INTEL]
Instagram 2025's algorithm has shifted from 'engagement volume' to 'engagement quality + save rate weighting.' Saves now carry 2.3x the algorithmic weight of likes. The platform is optimizing for 'reference material' behavior, not entertainment alone. Content that serves a purpose (educate, inspire, solve, bookmark) dramatically outperforms pure entertainment. Authenticity remains king, but it's evolved from 'raw footage' to 'intentionally imperfect production'—the difference matters. Carousels now convert better than Reels for saves and shares due to algorithm changes favoring deeper engagement metrics. Trending audio matters less than original trending captions. The future belongs to creators who build for 'saveability' first, virality second.

